build/
__pycache__/

# transient working files of build_person_index.rebuild() -- exist only during a rebuild
build-reports/.person-index.json.tmp
build-reports/person-index.json.prev

# STORE BACKUPS -- a copy of a build/ file taken before a run overwrites it. Ryan, 2026-09-11:
# not committed. They are session-scoped rollback aids, not backups: see docs/DATASET_PRECEDENTS.md,
# "A store backup is a rollback aid, not a backup". Name every one `<store>-store.before-<date>.json`.
# NOT this pattern: a file a gate or the service READS (a baseline, a reversal record) is a record,
# and a record is tracked -- src/gate_store_backups.py B3 refuses a backup anything reads.
build-reports/*-store.before-*.json

# a derived working database, rebuilt by src/census_table.py from the document corpus.
# The repo tracks no sqlite: the census REPORTS beside it are the record.
build-reports/corpus-census.sqlite
